{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8c416b03b0192cae25f73e76b5d4adf4d05565ed2dc4b9cea83ae8f04140143e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4821bbe615a2b350a9ceb52a43ca1767a8ac89a7efc31c6cad4acfa195684e23",
      "text": "瞻仰新年日出",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4b22c95b6da7db65d37f4d24fb82b9083884d176dddb1d426cccf41aeeb3c68",
      "text": "新年快乐！\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86291620e97e6b43dd6206f3acd28567afb9c10c69a36e923f28838759a7a82e",
      "text": "我一路飙着爱车冲到海边去了！然后，\n现在正跟玄武还有喵子一起排队等着新年参拜呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5725e8c343dd7c44dba14a25caa06ddc8936a8c5d1dbcff5d70301d184514f94",
      "text": "是骑自行车去的吗，\n真不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9979ed35297d736c69f9d1bcc523e724474610f059091c2678311d8ec6567c2",
      "text": "去了海边呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:278d80afda41b8a6be0bf0139c0424aac13ba8f39dec3d5c6e765fd06fc71a70",
      "text": "噢！安全驾驶，而且好好遵守了限速哦！\n我的爱车也高兴坏了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad5f82094dc2df2333d89cac15cf0c9c55d41759b1cd6e33072eec5a7bad1596",
      "text": "太阳把整片天空染得通红通红的。\n大海也在闪闪发光，超级漂亮啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56865fe6b383b4e9f71041d04bcc47dc37950ee50f85e24e24614301c83d7d8a",
      "text": "对了，我把电话转给玄武啊。稍微等一下！\n玄武，是制作人打来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:868a7a00e12e2a59d34e02a1adca8ec97da06bf90cc5ae4601ba67715f633efb",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，\n新年快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23d8e59379e0196a9fee26785868b0f29e6b926127ecbe22ef27879d0e1e7114",
      "text": "朱雀也说了，我们去看了新年日出。\n新春万福。那番光景让人觉得会迎来福气满满的一年啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:724ad8386ff032c0e226c25d56a6d2c0ad80dcbbb7f6d0ca9c9ca96c54febba4",
      "text": "就是这么回事，今年也拜托你了，番长。\n那就换回朱雀。……拿去，还给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39cdf34bf6bb63d71199f85ec689fe7f2fdf11eac96782ebce085bc9bde9655b",
      "text": "谢啦，玄武。制作人啊，\n喵子也说想跟你打个招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000044:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f953efaebae5403f9922b4fee82c1a24ce05a711c1575e7b305ff3c34518fbf",
      "text": "喵喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_009_23_5_00_009_23:5_00_009_23:cmd-000046:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61a4034656c67b6fccd92842794be6e86ae18d5a922c63862126e2e968aef0df",
      "text": "这样大家都打完招呼了。\n总之就是这样，神速一魂，今年也请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
